# Browser
# CR 404.3: "If an effect or rule puts two or more cards into the same graveyard at the same time, the owner of those cards
# may arrange them in any order." Satyr Wayfinder reveals Guerrilla Gorilla, Lightning Bolt, Llanowar Elves and Counterspell -
# no land - and puts all four into Bot1's graveyard together. With Corpse Dance in the game the order can be told apart, so
# Bot1 is asked it, and puts the Gorilla on top (the order revealed would have left the Elves the top creature card). Corpse
# Dance then returns the Gorilla, the top creature card, which attacks at once (haste) for 2.
# Bot1 Deck: Corpse Dance reads the graveyard's order.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Swamp
Satyr Wayfinder
Corpse Dance
Island
Island
Island
Guerrilla Gorilla
Lightning Bolt
Llanowar Elves
Counterspell
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

