Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Satyr Wayfinder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = 4 cards go to your graveyard together: put them in any order
Bot1.Arrange(Guerrilla Gorilla; Counterspell; Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Guerrilla Gorilla; Counterspell; Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
