Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Corpse Dance.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Guerrilla Gorilla > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

